notes, cash flow and directors report.\"","\"Financing inflow inside CFO; IFC report identifies 31 December 2023 rather than March 2024, limiting a full-year assurance claim.\"","\"E02\"","\"Full statutory audit and annexures, governance, accounting policies, financial statements and notes.\"","\"Inventory valuation could not be verified for insufficient records despite unmodified headline opinion; transition/comparative vintages retained.\"","\"E01\"","\"Full statutory audit pp42–49, financials pp52–75, governance, management discussion and notes; material scanned tables visually checked.\"","\"Inventory valuation and physical-verification assurance limitations; short-term funds ₹5.6456 crore used long term; due/proceeds/RPT/ageing/equity inconsistencies retained.\"","\"fact\"","\"consequence\"","\"A1\"","\"E01 p42; E02 p50\"","\"Inventory valuation not verified because records supplied were insufficient.\"","\"G2 Hold; CAP and EARN NS; no numerical quality ranking.\"","\"A2\"","\"E01 pp47,66\"","\"CARO lists undisputed tax ₹0.140162 crore and disputed ₹0.3357 crore, while Note28 calls ₹0.4759 crore all disputed.\"","\"Classification discrepancy, not a clean no-dues conclusion.\"","\"A3\"","\"E01 pp48,75\"","\"₹26 crore IPO capex less ₹8.1737 crore use equals ₹17.8263 crore; CARO unutilized figure is ₹18.0621 crore.\"","\"Use arithmetic-linked note in illustrative capex budget; retain conflicting ₹0.2358 crore residual.\"","\"A4\"","\"E01 p55; E02 cash flow\"","\"FY25 cash flow vintage totals do not reconcile to printed opening/closing cash; latest comparative capex zero contradicts prior ₹3.4713 crore.\"","\"Show both vintages; no invented reconciliation.\"","\"A5\"","\"E01 p58\"","\"Over-six-month receivable headline ₹12.8387 crore versus ageing bucket sum ₹10.4012 crore.\"","\"Both retained; ₹6.5402 crore is two to three years old.\"","\"A6\"","\"E01 pp67–68\"","\"Named related-party analytical expense ₹0.012 crore conflicts with aggregate NIL; receivable ₹0.2207 crore conflicts with total NIL.\"","\"Unresolved reporting discrepancy, not proof of misappropriation.\"","\"A7\"","\"E01 p60\"","\"Other-equity roll-forward final columns do not arithmetically reconcile with each other or balance-sheet equity.\"","\"Use balance-sheet headline only as reported; no clean audited-net-worth valuation assurance.\"","\"A8\"","\"E08–E11\"","\"Four batch-specific NSQ alerts across 2024–25 include assay/dissolution, description and weight-uniformity findings.\"","\"Verify corrective actions and product release controls; no inference of sitewide prohibition.\"","\"A9\"","\"E12\"","\"High Court quashed historical conviction in April 2026 because the company was not arraigned; legal procedural basis is explicit.\"","\"Do not describe overturned conviction as current. Other case statuses remain ND.\"","\"A10\"","\"E01 p47,75\"","\"₹5.6456 crore short-term funds applied long term; IPO utilization timeline extended to March 2027.\"","\"No new committed funding assumed; model rollover and zero-deposit-availability stresses.\"","\"Current bank sanction and deposit lien confirmations\"","\"Actual March-to-entry cash/proceeds utilization bridge\"","\"Current regulator inspection and NSQ corrective-action closure\"","\"Complete reconciliation of original and revised financial vintages\"","\"Current status of all legacy product litigation\"","\"Quarterly or half-year cash flow after March 2026 before cutoff\"","\"Independent credit-rating rationale\"","\"Customer-level receivable confirmations and inventory verification reports\"","\"date\"","\"url\"","\"location\"","\"evidence_type\"","\"retrieved\"","\"FY2026 annual report\"","\"2026-09-07\"","\"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/SME_AR_31660_QUESTLAB_2025_2026_A_20351415_07092026114809.pdf\"","\"Printed pp12–22,42–82; complete statutory report, CARO and IFC read; financial image tables visually checked.\"","\"V\"","\"Quest Laboratories Limited standalone\"","\"2026-10-23\"","\"0f80dafce1